    <PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>true</PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>
    <PackageLicenseFile></PackageLicenseFile>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/mParticle/mparticle-json</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/mParticle/mparticle-json</RepositoryUrl>
    <PackageTags>JSON Schema</PackageTags>
    <Copyright>Copyright (c) 2020, mParticle, Inc</Copyright>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>2.0.0 (breaking): JSON null is now represented as null and undefined as DBNull.Value; default(MPJson) and MPJson.From(null) are JSON null; MapAll/MapChildren abort on DBNull.Value; JsonPointer.Find returns DBNull.Value for a missing path. Targets net10.0 (was netstandard2.1). Also: 100 ms non-sticky regex timeout, culture-invariant number parsing and formatting. See CHANGELOG.md.</PackageReleaseNotes>
